1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:08,170
When you are happy with a strategy, you can run it for real.

2
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:12,090
Select a strategy and click Run.

3
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:16,450
Choose the account, the timeframe and the instrument.

4
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:21,810
Check the settings, like the trade size and the stop loss. The broker's minimum distance is shown under the stop and limit.

5
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:26,170
Risk controls can cap the lot size or stop it after a drawdown.

6
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:32,110
Click Run.

7
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:36,470
It is now running and watching the market for you.

8
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:40,330
The log shows everything it does.

9
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:44,690
These tabs show its trades, orders and results so far.

10
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:47,920
To stop it, click Stop.

11
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:51,800
Tick these to close its trades and cancel its orders as it stops.

12
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:57,620
Only trades this strategy placed are touched.

13
00:00:57,720 --> 00:01:00,620
The strategy has stopped.

